<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-27T00:38:52.461Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:38:52 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Jordan has intensified its campaign against militants in southern Syria, conducting airstrikes and ground attacks that have killed several civilians, according to recent reports. The kingdom also arrested three suspects linked to the deadly church attack that killed nine people. Syrian authorities have imposed new restrictions on women’s university access and attended a security university graduation in Riyadh, while a car bomb and a drone strike on the Damascus-Homs highway killed multiple individuals. The conflict continues after the fall of the Assad regime in December 2024, with 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/10/26/jordan-attacks-syria-in-response-to-karak-church-attack?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOYUZsc21FM3lWWk4zcGZkTEVpOFI2Znc5UElwR2pMZnN1RXFCUGl0VVVHSjY0aTlWTUE5YmNBdlVtOXBseWtCZnpmTDVHRHZ0OXRwb0Z2SF9OdTVldEY5OGxab3oyNDdDdlBKbXVWQndGejNSR0loa0IwRGRVeHBYNFZJeFlXUF9WMFViVXdCbmdZVVBTM0I4NVhoVFlzT1dvWXJ6TlZOOWh4REdQRE9XaS1WZEVXTnVM0gG-AUFVX3lxTE1SdUVkS3UxWk4wQ0ZnX0lfcGVwVUlxb1JJRUo2aVlSWXBoS3BOOFlraXFrWUJ1TWxldVQ3eXBwSlBOc0NiQmt6ZGdCUWRHbnB4QzV5RVdjd2NlbGJESkhWemVIbkQ0NktzYU5oV08xV0p5c0tDNWVxMk9ESElnVlhmSF9TLW5Oc2szTlJHS0dTQTc2NzdxLXZRTERQY18yLTVWOGdRODJIWGVNdHZQU18zN3BsQndoMGlvMzNQcmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNUTllN3l2ZlZVNHh2Vm9lZkpvay02eHlqa3pTOHZXNGdVQlRUZTRuWFA5WEJWcXRnMjZ3WHNQSE1rWFRiUmxyLTYwejdnUy02WkRBMnRiQmtGNEtRX2RzQ1loTFVnNjBpRUEyc2Y3TWNxV1NvTEZhaXVzN0xNOVNDY1pDQWhVQUxCcDhmS2JsU0YyQnlYc3pFNGtsS2o1Wm1Kc0p2RzFmODRodVdZNTU4cktyOGVVcVk?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, 